                        "glosses": [
                            "The act or process, or an instance, of upholstering again (that is, redoing some upholstery), usually to restore a chair or automotive seat that is worn out."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
